  "_commit": {
    "id": "9431ea93b75ee7542b4f459e9426a7188ff392ef",
    "author": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "Warn in readGeoParquet() when no geometry column is found\n\nLambda noticed that reading an ordinary, non-spatial parquet file\n(e.g. iris.parquet) through readGeoParquet() silently returned\nnon-spatial data with no indication anything was off. Add a geom=\nparameter and check it with hasGeometry() after the read, warning\n(not erroring) when the expected GEOMETRY-typed column isn't present,\nsince the read itself is still valid for plain tabular data.\n",
    "time": 1793113342
  },
